    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Corry Estates are delighted to welcome to the market a charming, fully refurbished two bedroom detached cottage perfectly positioned within the heart of Skerries. Upon entering viewers will be instantly wowed by the light filled living accommodation that comprises of an open plan kitchen / living / dining area with open fire, two generous sized double bedrooms and a modern bathroom suite. The house has been recently modernised and refurbished to include a new gas fired radiator central heating system, full re-wire, new kitchen & PVC double glazed windows along with a brand new roof. Further features include laminate flooring and private driveway with off street parking. The location is ideal with all possible amenities on your doorstep including a host of local shops, schools, cafes, restaurants and sporting activities. Public transport is provided by train to Dublin city centre and there is easy access to the M1 motor way. Viewing comes highly recommended to appreciate all this detached cottage has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Open Plan Kitchen / Living / Dining Area\r\n4.57m (15'0\") x 4.64m (15'3\") Range of fitted press units. Plumbed for integrated dishwasher and integrated fridge freezer. Laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n7.6m (24'11\") x 3.4m (11'2\") Carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.59m (11'9\") x 3.29m (10'10\") Carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.9m (9'6\") x 2.01m (6'7\") Comprising of corner shower, w.h.b., & w.c. Tiled floor."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming two bedroom detached cottage in the heart of Skerries\r\n\r\nFully refurbished with open plan living\r\n\r\nNew gas fired central heating system\r\n\r\nPVC Double glazed windows\r\n\r\nDriveway for off-street parking"
      },
